Runtime components
==================

Cactus Whistle (whistle.cact)
  Apache-2.0. 16.9 MB speech-to-text model, bundled locally under
  models/cactus/whistle.cact.
  https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/whistle

cactus-rs / cactus-sys
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Safe Rust bindings and the prebuilt native engine.
  https://github.com/hxphsts/cactus-rs
  https://github.com/cactus-compute/cactus

cpal / clipboard-win / windows-rs / image / regex / serde / toml
  MIT, Apache-2.0 or BSD-style licenses. Standard Rust crates.

Bundled runtime DLLs
====================

The Windows gnullvm build needs `libc++.dll` from LLVM MinGW for the Cactus
engine. It is bundled in `runtime/` and copied next to `fasttts.exe` by
`install-shortcut.ps1`.

The 16.9 MB Whistle model is bundled locally for this checkout but excluded
from Git because model binaries are not source. No other model weights are
committed to the Rust repository.
